    {
        "content": "<p>Of course using the typeclass system for this is a bit dubious but I feel there is no easy way of attaching meta-level stuff to an expression based on unification. Writing environment extension + matching every time is such a chore.</p>",
        "id": 603867223,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1781632115
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Unfortunately I don't know how to write it such that pattern matching works e.g. <code>let h[[a, b], [c, d]] := x</code></p>",
